    </section>

    <section style="padding: 28px 24px 80px; background: #f8fafc;">
      <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <div style="background: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px 34px; box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08); font-size: 16px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.85;">
          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px;">1. Introduction and Acceptance</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">These Terms of Service govern your use of SerpEyes, including our website at serpeyes.com and all related software, tools and services. SerpEyes is operated by UWSM Pte Ltd, a company incorporated in Singapore.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">By accessing or using SerpEyes, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use our platform or services.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">These terms form a legally binding agreement between you and UWSM Pte Ltd. Please read them carefully.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">2. Definitions</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">In these Terms of Service:</p>
          <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px 24px;">
            <li>"SerpEyes", "we", "us" and "our" refers to UWSM Pte Ltd trading as SerpEyes.</li>
            <li>"Platform" refers to the SerpEyes software application and all its features and modules.</li>
            <li>"Services" refers to the Platform and any related services including managed SEO services offered by SerpEyes.</li>
            <li>"User", "you" and "your" refers to any individual or organisation accessing or using the Platform or Services.</li>
            <li>"Content" refers to any data, reports, articles or other material generated through the Platform.</li>
            <li>"Subscription" refers to a paid or free plan giving you access to the Platform.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">3. Eligibility</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">You must be at least 18 years old to use SerpEyes. By using our Platform you confirm that you meet this requirement.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">If you are using SerpEyes on behalf of a company or organisation, you confirm that you have authority to bind that entity to these terms.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">4. Account Registration</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">To access SerpEyes you must create an account. You agree to:</p>
          <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px 24px;">
            <li>Provide accurate and complete information when registering</li>
            <li>Keep your login credentials secure and confidential</li>
            <li>Notify us immediately if you suspect unauthorised access to your account</li>
            <li>Take responsibility for all activity that occurs under your account</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms or that we reasonably believe have been compromised.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">5. Early Access</h2>
