            <li>Access is provided free of charge. We do not guarantee uninterrupted access or the availability of all features during early access.</li>
            <li>We may make significant changes to features, modules or the platform structure based on user feedback. We will communicate significant changes in advance where possible.</li>
            <li>Early access does not constitute a binding commitment to any specific pricing, feature set or launch timeline.</li>
            <li>By participating in early access, you agree to provide honest feedback when requested and to use the platform in good faith.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">6. Subscriptions and Payment</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">When paid plans launch, the following terms will apply:</p>
          <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px 24px;">
            <li><strong>Billing:</strong> Subscriptions are billed monthly or annually in advance depending on the plan you select. All prices are in Singapore Dollars unless otherwise stated.</li>
            <li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> You may cancel your subscription at any time. Cancellation takes effect at the end of your current billing period. We do not provide refunds for partial billing periods.</li>
            <li><strong>Price changes:</strong> We will notify you at least 30 days before changing subscription prices. Continued use after the notice period constitutes acceptance of the new pricing.</li>
            <li><strong>Failed payments:</strong> If a payment fails, we will attempt to contact you. If payment is not resolved within 14 days, we reserve the right to suspend access to your account.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">7. Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">You agree to use SerpEyes only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these terms. You must not:</p>
          <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px 24px;">
            <li>Use the Platform to audit websites you do not own or have explicit permission to audit</li>
            <li>Attempt to reverse engineer, copy or replicate any part of the Platform or its underlying methodology</li>
            <li>Use automated scripts or bots to access the Platform in ways not authorised by us</li>
            <li>Share your account credentials with others outside your organisation</li>
            <li>Use the Platform to generate content that is misleading, defamatory or in violation of any applicable law</li>
