            <li>You are responsible for ensuring the accuracy of any branding, contact information or additional content you add to reports.</li>
            <li>You may share white-label reports with your clients as part of your own service offering.</li>
            <li>You must not present white-label reports as independently verified third party assessments or misrepresent their source in a way that could mislead your clients.</li>
            <li>SerpEyes retains no claim over the client relationships you manage using our Platform.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">9. Intellectual Property</h2>
