          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">10. Data and Privacy</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Your use of SerpEyes is subject to our Privacy Policy, which is incorporated into these terms by reference. By using SerpEyes you agree to our Privacy Policy.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">When you connect third party accounts such as Google Search Console, you authorise SerpEyes to access and process the relevant data in accordance with the permissions you grant and our Privacy Policy.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">11. Third Party Services</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">SerpEyes integrates with third party services including Google Search Console. Your use of these integrations is subject to the relevant third party terms of service. We are not responsible for the availability, accuracy or conduct of any third party service.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">12. Disclaimers</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">SerpEyes provides SEO intelligence, analysis and recommendations. We do not guarantee specific search engine ranking outcomes.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Search engine algorithms change frequently and are outside our control. Improvements in rankings depend on many factors beyond the use of our Platform including the quality of implementation, market competition and search engine policy changes.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">The Platform is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We do not warrant that the Platform will be uninterrupted, error-free or completely secure. We make no warranties, express or implied, beyond those required by applicable Singapore law.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">13. Limitation of Liability</h2>
