            <li>Any damages arising from reliance on Platform-generated recommendations</li>
            <li>Any issues arising from third party services integrated with the Platform</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Our total liability to you for any claim arising from these terms or your use of the Platform shall not exceed the total amount you paid us in the three months preceding the claim, or SGD 100 if you have not made any payment.</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded under Singapore law.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">14. Managed SEO Services</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Where you engage SerpEyes for managed SEO services rather than or in addition to the Platform, the following additional terms apply:</p>
          <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px 24px;">
            <li><strong>Scope of work:</strong> The specific services, deliverables and timelines will be agreed in writing before work begins.</li>
            <li><strong>Client responsibilities:</strong> You agree to provide us with timely access to your website, hosting, Google accounts and any other assets reasonably required to deliver the service.</li>
            <li><strong>Results:</strong> We will work diligently to improve your search rankings but we do not guarantee specific ranking positions or traffic levels. Search engine rankings depend on many factors outside our control.</li>
            <li><strong>Cancellation of services:</strong> Either party may terminate managed SEO services with 30 days written notice. You remain responsible for payment of any fees due up to the termination date.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">15. Confidentiality</h2>
