          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">You may terminate your account at any time by contacting us at hello@serpeyes.com.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">17. Governing Law and Disputes</h2>
