          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">If any provision of these terms is found to be unenforceable by a Singapore court, that provision will be modified to the minimum extent necessary to make it enforceable. The remaining provisions will continue in full force and effect.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">20. Entire Agreement</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">These Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy constitute the entire agreement between you and UWSM Pte Ltd regarding your use of SerpEyes and supersede any prior agreements or understandings.</p>

